    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_20061230.0254\n\nWATFORD, England, Dec 30 , 2006, 2006\n\nHeavy rain stops Watford-Wigan match\n\n\n\n\nThe English Premiership match between Watford and Wigan at Vicarage Road on Saturday was abandoned due to a waterlogged pitch.\n\nReferee Steve Tanner called a halt to proceedings about 15 minutes into the second half with the scores level at 1-1 as rain lashed down.\n\nEmile Heskey had given the visitors the lead before Tamas Priskin headed an equaliser for Watford.",
